{"id":"f62ab4c80ccedf7e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-depth.md","title":"df-circuit-depth (Circuit Depth)","display":"df-circuit-depth (Circuit Depth)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"display":"df-circuit-depth (Circuit Depth)","label":"28-df-circuit-depth","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-circuit-depth","Circuit Depth"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1","source_printed_pages":"107–108,117","source_pdf_pages":"133–134,143","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-depth (Circuit Depth)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-depth"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-depth</span><span>Circuit Depth</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108,117"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133–134,143"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,(o_1,\\ldots,o_m),\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\">\\(C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,(o_1,\\ldots,o_m),\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{layer}_C:V\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{layer}_C:V\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{layer}_C(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0, &amp; \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n1+\\displaystyle\\max_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{layer}_C(u),\n&amp; \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{layer}_C(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0, &amp; \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n1+\\displaystyle\\max_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{layer}_C(u),\n&amp; \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\max_{1\\le r\\le m}\\operatorname{layer}_C(o_r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\max_{1\\le r\\le m}\\operatorname{layer}_C(o_r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1，印刷页 107–108,117；PDF 页 133–134,143。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C=(V,E,\\vec\\imath,(o_1,\\ldots,o_m),\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{layer}_C:V\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{layer}_C(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0, & \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n1+\\displaystyle\\max_{u\\in\\operatorname{pred}_C(v)}\\operatorname{layer}_C(u),\n& \\operatorname{pred}_C(v)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\max_{1\\le r\\le m}\\operatorname{layer}_C(o_r).","display":true}],"bytes":1325,"backlinks":[{"id":"51d96e53efebc2d6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"154f028fc8ad4b75","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\Gamma_n,\\operatorname{pred}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\gamma_\\wedge=\\mathsf{and},\\gamma_\\vee=\\mathsf{or},\\gamma_\\neg=\\mathsf{not}$ 为其既有门标签；$\\mathsf M$ 是互异新增标签。$\\operatorname{depth}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-depth]]。"},{"id":"348985e8f68576a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$、$\\operatorname{depth}$ 分别见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔电路：[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]、[[28-df-formula-size]]。"},{"id":"3bf0fbe848a49bdc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d"]}